<title>UK: London precious metals end lower post option expiry.</title>
<headline>London precious metals end lower post option expiry.</headline>
<text>
<p>GOLD - Closed at $339.80/$340.30 vs $342.20/$343.70 Friday.</p>
<p>Weaker all day on stronger dollar. Lost further ground post OTC option expiry. Bearish.</p>
<p>SILVER - Also ended off at $4.65/$4.67, down seven cents. Found support at $4.61 after fall post expiry.</p>
<p>PLATINUM - Ended down $6.00 at $373.00/$374.00.</p>
<p>PALLADIUM - Finished down $2.55 at $156.75/$157.75.</p>
</text>
